    "Implement Kafka partitioning key logic to natively handle single downstream modules without falling back to default behavior.",
    "Introduce a new status enum or constant for 'undeployed' in the Mesos SPI to replace 'unknown'."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer is highly experienced with the Spring ecosystem, including Spring XD, Spring Cloud Data Flow, and Spring Hadoop.",
    "Existing automated test suites are available and will be updated to cover the new features and upgrades.",
